benchmarks/ulr_vs_upl -- the programs of Figure 6 (Ultimate-LR vs Ultimate-PL)
================================================================================

1,087 programs, 1,048 C and 39 Boogie, all of them also in benchmarks/ulr_vs_pulr: the programs of
the paper's Ultimate-LR vs Ultimate-PL run, whose Ultimate logs are in logs/ULR_vs_UPL_logs.zip.
They were selected by the difficulty of their lassos in ULR-Baseline vs P-ULR (benchmarks/ulr_vs_pulr,
Table 1). In logs/results_P-ULR-Seq_z3.csv, the slowest lasso of each of these programs took ULR-Baseline
110 ms (median), against 10 ms for the 1,769 other programs.
